"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"European countries and Canada are putting pressure on Israel because of its plans to expand settlements in an important part of the West Bank. This area is occupied, and the expansion is causing concern.\",            \"english_title\": \"Pressure on Israel\",            \"translated_version\": \"Pa\u00edses de Europa y Canad\u00e1 est\u00e1n presionando a Israel por sus planes de expandir asentamientos en una parte importante de Cisjordania. Esta \u00e1rea est\u00e1 ocupada y la expansi\u00f3n preocupa.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Presi\u00f3n sobre Israel\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Scientists are saying that the El Ni\u00f1o weather pattern is growing and is an 'unprecedented event'. They believe this means that 2027 could be the hottest year ever recorded in the world.\",            \"english_title\": \"El Ni\u00f1o Growing\",            \"translated_version\": \"Cient\u00edficos dicen que el fen\u00f3meno del clima El Ni\u00f1o est\u00e1 creciendo y es un evento sin precedentes. Creen que esto significa que 2027 podr\u00eda ser el a\u00f1o m\u00e1s caliente registrado en el mundo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"El Ni\u00f1o Crece\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"At least 17 people were killed in a big attack on Ukraine's capital overnight. The mayor, Vitali Klitschko, has warned that the hot water supply has been disrupted because of the attack.\",            \"english_title\": \"Attack on Ukraine\",            \"translated_version\": \"Al menos 17 personas murieron en un gran ataque en la capital de Ucrania durante la noche. El alcalde, Vitali Klitschko, ha advertido que el suministro de agua caliente ha sido interrumpido por el ataque.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataque en Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Prosecutors say a woman from Albany had pledged allegiance to the Islamic State group. She wanted to bomb the statehouse to kill lawmakers.\",            \"english_title\": \"Woman's Allegiance\",            \"translated_version\": \"Fiscales dicen que una mujer de Albany prometi\u00f3 lealtad al grupo Estado Isl\u00e1mico. Ella quer\u00eda bombardear el capitolio para matar a legisladores.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Lealtad de Mujer\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"US military exercises with South Korea are ending early on Friday. This is happening at a time when North Korea is in a strong position.\",            \"english_title\": \"Military Exercises End\",            \"translated_version\": \"Ejercicios militares de EE.UU. con Corea del Sur terminan temprano el viernes. Esto pasa cuando Corea del Norte est\u00e1 en una posici\u00f3n fuerte.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Fin de Ejercicios Militares\"        }    ]}"